## 1. Node Exporter Installation (System Metrics Collection - Port 9100)
Downloaded and initialized Node Exporter to track core hardware and OS performance metrics:
```bash
[root@target-node ~]# wget https://github.com/prometheus/node_exporter/releases/download/v1.7.0/node_exporter-1.7.0.linux-amd64.tar.gz
tar -xvf node_exporter-1.7.0.linux-amd64.tar.gz
cd node_exporter-1.7.0.linux-amd64
nohup ./node_exporter > /dev/null 2>&1 &

[root@target-node ~]# wget https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter/releases/download/v0.13.4/apache_exporter-0.13.4.linux-amd64.tar.gz
tar -xvf apache_exporter-0.13.4.linux-amd64.tar.gz
cd apache_exporter-0.13.4.linux-amd64/
nohup ./apache_exporter --scrape_uri="http://localhost:80/server-status?auto" > apache.log 2>&1 &

firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=80/tcp
firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=9100/tcp
firewall-cmd --permanent --add-port=9117/tcp
firewall-cmd --reload
firewall-cmd --list-all

systemctl enable --now httpd
systemctl status httpd
[root@target-node ~]# curl localhost
